Inter Regular (400) and Bold (700), latin subset, from @fontsource/inter 5.3.0.
Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter),
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org).
These are the built-in default fonts for every print: Satori falls back to
them when no fontFamily is set, and the built-in test label uses them. Static
WOFF, because FitText measures text with opentype.js, which can't read WOFF2,
and Satori renders a variable font only as its default instance.
